    "Feature names are the background-table feature names as printed in the 2014 PHB, not the variant-feature names used by most wikis (for example the PHB prints 'Soldier' and 'Urchin', whose variants are 'Military Rank' and 'City Secrets'; the PHB prints 'Sailor R.P.G.', whose variant is 'Ship's Passage').",
    "Feature text is intentionally omitted: `desc` is empty and `featureTextAvailable` is false.",
